    <div class="ea-disclaimer">
      <p>*This is a sponsored story. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Individual results vary. Testimonials are from verified buyers and do not represent or guarantee that anyone will achieve the same results.</p>
      <p>Lauren is a composite spokesperson based on documented customer experiences. This advertorial will be updated with a verified real customer story prior to going live. The testimonial from Christine H. is from a verified buyer of the protocol referenced in this article.</p>
      <p>This article references research from Camacho-Pereira et al. (Cell Metabolism, 2016), Yang et al. (Nature Aging, 2024), and the GeroScience 2024 NMN purity study. All papers are publicly available and linked at emberprotokol.com. Ember is a dietary supplement. Consult your healthcare provider before starting any supplement.</p>
